# viewpane, the image viewer built with vib (its 455 by 410 window): Meta-O (Alt) opens the library's file dialog, the typed path of a GIF
# of the oracle's own tree (wwwcube.gif, 128 by 144; the dialog's field holds 50 characters, and no larger GIF has a path that short) and
# Return (Okay) show it in the 300 by 300 pane; the horizontal and the vertical scroll bars are dragged (the image fits, so they move only
# their thumbs), the Hide button is pressed, and Meta-Q ends the program by itself
move 180 200
keydown Alt_L
key o
keyup Alt_L
wait
type /home/resources/icon-master/doc/wwwcube.gif
wait
key Return
wait
drag 1 180 371 280 371
wait
drag 1 341 210 341 100
wait
move 404 70
press 1
release 1
wait
move 180 200
keydown Alt_L
key q
keyup Alt_L
